# scratch-region-log.patch. TERTIUS_X_FRAME_TIME_TARGET=<ms> gives a headless run the dynamic render scale
# FrameTimeTarget(<ms>, 0.5, 1). TERTIUS_X_SIZE_LOG=<folder> logs each draw's render size. TERTIUS_X_SIZE_REPLAY=<size
# log> makes each draw take the scale that an earlier run's size log gives for its frame number. TERTIUS_X_TIME_LOG=<folder>
# logs each collected frame's GPU span and the controller's cost sums.
