+        // SCRATCH (t0-5tyj, never commit to src): with TERTIUS_X_TIME_LOG=<folder>, each collect appends one line
+        // "<frame number> <GPU span> <before the output> <at the render size> <output>", in ms, to <folder>/time-<
+        // TERTIUS_PROBE_LAMP_OFF, or "none">.txt. The second and third sums are the controller's costs (RenderScaleController
